": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2VM6jj8EMIQQ7kNvwFur8RZ&_nc_oc=AdnCDUsGcR11RD3WxMXgiDxoftATG0mUz-0nDUHT2ttppSWfJLTKAzrmiYQfrLf69fA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuyn4TxaudiznnMJZKPRymSArcxKqsmFVMynZWyjNbPHw&oe=699843CA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0UsK6-HdHkgQ7kNvwHMMZAd&_nc_oc=AdnmVTUU8l1YHI39k_SaRVSdDzPTJSvv6hopriWGvrK0TfOMK3hwDiXf_fkQu1mDy3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuZVVl_x5orEvfkfxmSsF0qknOITCXv2eVFur1iOWa1kw&oe=69985404"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R_LlQqBJES4Q7kNvwGyqCdv&_nc_oc=AdmD5-V-HOEcb2kOB18ecI4rb7TEvS4BCCcJFqcTBex2WdD6ys1YYqYX6Hnwwahx3qw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuvf6sOSgMc7veCaGNbFYnrL_K8Ft5HBC-Xh438wRcRwg&oe=699859DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kp_WsH0PckIQ7kNvwHcuXfW&_nc_oc=AdmIvGUwESSkVmTagBM6zGMTOEL-xtpS5eX1MSpaSBBWpXFK2Ltr8dmMzMCctE32kC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuVQnOgQfNuzKqeaJNX3eg3UM7Q_n08yNNzTTCmWJyA4w&oe=6998448C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com